│ # flk cheat sheet                                                            │
│                                                                              │
│ What's going on?                                                             │
│   flk context                        this app: machines, ports, what to do … │
│   flk context --all                  every app on this host                  │
│   flk doctor                         host health, each problem with its fix  │
│                                                                              │
│ Run an app (in its directory, with a Dockerfile, flk.toml or fly.toml)       │
│   flk launch --no-deploy             write flk.toml if missing, register th… │
│   flk volumes create data --size 1   one per machine, for [[mounts]] source… │
│   flk secrets set KEY=VALUE --stage  env vars kept out of flk.toml           │
│   flk deploy                         build, then create or update the machi… │
│   flk status                         machines, IPs, states                   │
│                                                                              │
│ Look inside                                                                  │
│   flk logs [-i ID] [-n 200] [-f]     app output and boot messages            │
│   flk console [ID]                   type to the app (server consoles); lea… │
│   flk console --send "say hi"        one line to the app, no attaching (--w… │
│   flk machine status ID              everything flk knows about a machine    │
│                                                                              │
